TEST=  behaviour change for this build; usage 0xb00 contiguous and linear;
TEST=  __ANDROID__ 0xb00 not contiguous but still linear, soft set empty;
TEST=  decoder/camera required, contiguous and linear in both; a pure-GPU
TEST=  buffer neither contiguous nor linear.
TEST=Deployed to a 4K rpi4 and confirmed Chrome runs clean on it.
TEST=NOT verified on hardware for the bug itself: reproducing FYDE-571 needs the
TEST=ARC kiosk up at 4K, which is blocked on the DUT (enrolled kiosk will not
TEST=auto-launch, see FYDE-559/558 RTC chain). A/B at the login screen shows no
TEST=difference, as expected -- that state allocates almost nothing.

